@startuml
!theme plain
title Kafka Producer Client State Machine

[*] --> Initialized : create KafkaProducer()

Initialized --> Connecting : first send() / initiate connection
Initialized --> Closed : close() / cleanup resources

Connecting --> Ready : connection established / metadata received
Connecting --> ConnectionFailed : connection timeout/network error
Connecting --> Closed : close() during connection

ConnectionFailed --> Connecting : retry() [retry < maxRetries] / backoff delay
ConnectionFailed --> Closed : [retry >= maxRetries] / give up

Ready --> Sending : send(ProducerRecord) / enqueue message
Ready --> Flushing : flush() / force send buffered messages  
Ready --> Closed : close() / drain and close

Sending --> Ready : message sent successfully / ack received
Sending --> SendFailed : send timeout/broker error
Sending --> Flushing : flush() while sending
Sending --> Closed : close() / abort pending sends

SendFailed --> Ready : [retries available] / retry message
SendFailed --> Failed : [no retries left] / callback with error
SendFailed --> Closed : close() / abort failed sends

Flushing --> Ready : all buffered messages sent / flush complete
Flushing --> FlushTimeout : flush timeout exceeded
Flushing --> Closed : close() during flush / force close

FlushTimeout --> Ready : continue normal operation
FlushTimeout --> Closed : close() / force shutdown

Failed --> Ready : continue with new messages
Failed --> Closed : close() / cleanup

Closed --> [*] : resources released

note right of Connecting : Metadata refresh\nBootstrap servers\nCluster discovery
note right of Sending : Batching enabled\nCompression applied\nPartition assignment
note right of SendFailed : Retries: retry.backoff.ms\nMax retries: retries
note right of Flushing : Timeout: max.block.ms\nBatch processing
note right of Ready : Idle state\nAccepts new messages\nBackground metadata refresh

state Ready {
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> MetadataRefresh : metadata.max.age.ms expired
  MetadataRefresh --> Idle : metadata updated
}

state Sending {
  [*] --> Batching
  Batching --> NetworkSend : batch.size reached OR linger.ms timeout
  NetworkSend --> AckWait : request sent to broker
  AckWait --> [*] : acks received
}

@enduml